<title>USA: Koll Real Estate Group Inc Q4 loss.</title>
<headline>Koll Real Estate Group Inc Q4 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				    Three months		Year</p>
<p>					 Ended		   Ended</p>
<p>				    December 31,	  December 31,</p>
<p>			     1996	  1995	1996     1995</p>
<p>Revenues		  $ 19.7     $ 15.1     $ 44.8	 $34.0</p>
<p>Net loss (B)	 $ (6.7)    $(100.1)   $(28.9)	$(116.9)</p>
<p>Net loss per common</p>
<p> share		 $ (.14)    $ (2.11)   $ (.60)	$ (2.48)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>common shares</p>
<p> outstanding (A)	48.9	  47.5	48.3	    47.1</p>
<p>(A) The increase in the weighted average common shares outstanding reflects the conversion during 1996 of 1.4 million shares of the Series A Preferred Stock into an equal number of shares of common stock.  The Series A Preferred is not included in the calculation of weighted average shares outstanding because the effect is antidilutive.</p>
<p>(B) The net loss for the 1995 periods reflects asset revaluations of $116.6 million and $124.1 million for the fourth quarter and full-year, respectively, which were partially offset by income tax benefits of $24.0 million and $26.6 million, respectively.</p>
